printing.sizing_note = Long fit mod, foto i fulumap evri bokis be oli no katemaot wan haf blong hem. Tru saes i yusum DPI blong dokumen; sipos foto i no save fit, mekem namba blong ol bokis i smol moa. Printim PDF long 100% mo no yusum fit-to-page.
