printing.limit = Wok blong print i bitim limit: 200 image, 40 milian piksel / 32768 piksel long wanwan saed blong wanwan image, o 256 MiB blong PDF data we oli kompresem.
printing.profile_error = Image ia i gat wan kala profael we i no stret, i no semak o sistem i no sapotem. Original CMYK/Lab i nidim wan stret profael insaed long fael; RGB i nidim wan RGB profael.
