printing.caption_limit = Smol toktok blong foto i longfala tumas long grid ia. Yusum smol namba blong laen o kolom, mekem toktok i sot moa, o ofem ol smol toktok.
printing.font_error = I no gat wan font blong smol toktok blong foto. Instolem wan font blong teks o ofem ol smol toktok.
printing.no_document = Openem wan dokumen o jusum ol foto long galeri bifo yu printim.
printing.source_error = Program i no save ridim wan foto we yu jusum, wan saed fael we yu editim, o smol toktok blong hem. I no sevem eni PDF.
printing.save_error = I no save sevem PDF. Jusum wan niufala nem blong fael long wan folda we yu save raetem long hem; program i neva riplesem ol fael we oli stap finis.
printing.downloaded = PDF i finis daonlod. Openem long wan program blong luk PDF mo printim long 100%.
